# Project Rules

## Stack
- Frontend: React + Tailwind CSS
- Package manager: npm
- Language: JavaScript/TypeScript

## Conventions
- Commits: Conventional Commits format (feat, fix, docs, chore)
- Components: functional, PascalCase filenames
- Styling: Tailwind utilities, no inline styles

## Lessons from FE-03 (workflow drill)
- Always list the exact fields/props required — never let the AI infer scope from a vague description.
- Forms use react-hook-form + zod for validation, not manual useState + regex.
- Any new component with logic (validation, state transitions) needs accompanying tests written and run before it's considered done.